sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Student
 participant B as Browser
 participant API as Accounts API
 participant TU as TU API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 U->>B: Enter university credentials
 B->>API: GET /api/v1/auth/csrf
 API-->>B: CSRF cookie/token
 B->>API: POST auth/login JSON + CSRF
 API->>API: Validate input
 API->>TU: HTTPS verify + application key (10s timeout)
 alt Rejected credentials / ineligible / provider failure
 API-->>B: 401 / 403 / 502, no authenticated session
 else Verified and eligible
 API->>DB: Get/create local user, identity and profile atomically
 API->>API: Django login, set expiry and university_identity_id
 API-->>B: 200 logged_in + local user id, session cookie
 end
 Note over API,DB: University password is forwarded, not stored as a local password
 B->>API: POST auth/logout + CSRF
 API->>API: Logout / flush session
 API-->>B: Logout response
